    "body": "The specification often talks about child browsing contexts of elements and/or documents. I'm not even sure it makes sense to talk about a browsing context's child browsing contexts, since those change over time and would no longer make sense if the browsing context was navigated (you'd get the wrong results, potentially cross-origin bad results).\n\nIt seems like another thing we have to badly refactor as it turned into some mess.\n",
